rows.en:
"{a}{f:|}, want to touch it?
Don't worry, it absolutely won't move."
With that, he brought the flower right up in front of {f:me|me}.{p}

"{f:Waaah|Eeek}☆"
{f:I|I} thought my heart was going to stop.
All of a sudden, the flower had started to sway{f:.|...}
Hosoda had shaken it on purpose to tease {f:me|me}{f:.|, hadn't he?}{p}

"Either you don't believe my story, or you don't understand my suffering... it's one or the other.
Don't come crying to me. There's no telling when this misfortune might strike you."
With that, Hosoda put the flower away as if it were something precious.{p}

(Takeuchi must know something about that plant.)
Convinced of that, I decided to look into the plant.
Once I'd made sure Takeuchi had gone inside the school building, I immediately doubled back.{p}

Takeuchi, too, seemed to have neutralized the poison; his face was back to normal.
And he was starting to fill the dug-up ground back in.
But I wondered why there had been maggots in the soil, so I peeked over Takeuchi's back into the hole he'd dug.{p}

A hand jutting out of the ground was gripping my foot.
I kicked at the hand with my other foot, trying to get away.
But that foot got grabbed too, and there was nothing I could do.{p}

"Gyaah☆"
{f:Hosoda|It struck him, and}{f:| Hosoda} collapsed, blood spurting from his head.
The instant the flowerpot shattered, the flower that had been biting {f:my|my} hand withered away too.{p}
